[TITLE]
InpWriter round-trip fixture: section order
Exercises defect 10: CONDUITS / WEIRS / XSECTIONS / STREETS / INLETS all
declared BEFORE JUNCTIONS / OUTFALLS, so the link end nodes are forward
references that only the deferred pass can bind.

NOTE: this fixture also carries an INLET_USAGE row naming the forward node J5.
handle_inlet_usage() has no deferred pass and drops any row it cannot resolve,
so that row never reaches the writer. Defect 5 is covered by inlet_usage.inp
instead. That reader gap is a known, separate defect.

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CFS
INFILTRATION         HORTON
FLOW_ROUTING         DYNWAVE
START_DATE           01/01/2020
START_TIME           00:00:00
END_DATE             01/02/2020
END_TIME             00:00:00
REPORT_STEP          00:15:00
WET_STEP             00:05:00
DRY_STEP             01:00:00
ROUTING_STEP         0:00:30
MIN_SLOPE            0

[EVAPORATION]
CONSTANT   0.0
DRY_ONLY   NO

;; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
;; Link sections come FIRST. Legacy SWMM parsing is order-independent; before
;; the deferred link end-node pass these links loaded with node1/node2 == -1
;; (silently orphaned) and were then written back out with '*' end nodes.
;; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

[CONDUITS]
;;Name  FromNode  ToNode  Length  Roughness  InOffset  OutOffset
GUT1     J3        J4      300.0   0.016      0         0
C2       J4        O1      300.0   0.013      0         0

[WEIRS]
;;Name  FromNode  ToNode  Type        CrestHt  Cd    Gated  EC  Cd2  Sur
W1       J3        J4      TRANSVERSE  1.0      3.33  NO     0   0    YES

[XSECTIONS]
;;Link  Shape     Geom1  Geom2  Geom3  Geom4  Barrels
GUT1     STREET    ST_A
C2       CIRCULAR  2.0    0      0      0      1
W1       RECT_OPEN 1.0    2.0    0      0

[STREETS]
;;Name  Tcrown  Hcurb  Sx  nRoad  Hdep  Wg  Sides  Tback  Sback  nBack
ST_A     20.0    0.5    4   0.016  0     0   2      20.0   0.04   0.016

[INLETS]
;;Name  Type   Length  Width  GrateType
IN_A     GRATE  2.0     2.0    P_BAR-50

[INLET_USAGE]
;; Parsed but previously never written — every inlet assignment was lost on save.
;;Link  Inlet  Node  #Inlets  %Clog  Qmax  aLocal  wLocal  Placement
GUT1     IN_A   J5    1        0      0     0       0       ON_GRADE

[JUNCTIONS]
;;Name  Elev  MaxDepth  InitDepth  SurDepth  Aponded
J3       12.0  5.0       0          0         0
J4       11.0  5.0       0          0         0
J5       10.0  5.0       0          0         0

[OUTFALLS]
;;Name  Elev  Type  StageData  Gated
O1       9.0   FREE  *          NO

[REPORT]
INPUT       NO
CONTROLS    NO
NODES       ALL
LINKS       ALL

[COORDINATES]
;;Node  X-Coord  Y-Coord
J3       0.0      0.0
J4       300.0    0.0
J5       300.0    100.0
O1       600.0    0.0
